A caption host and a continuation cell read what the block holds

```
|= a | < |
+ | | c |
.
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col" colspan="2">a</th><th scope="col">c</th></tr>
  </thead>
</table>
```

```
| < |= a |
+ | | c |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td></td><th scope="row">a</th><td>c</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
![a](/i) %% c
^ cap
.
<figure>
  <img src="/i" alt="a">
  <figcaption>cap</figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
![a](/i){%%}
^ cap
.
<figure>
  <img src="/i" alt="a">
  <figcaption>cap</figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
![a](/i) {% c %}
^ cap
.
<p><img src="/i" alt="a"> 
^ cap</p>
```

```
> >
^ cap
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>

  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
<p>^ cap</p>
```

```
> :::
> :::
^ cap
.
<blockquote>
  <div>

  </div>
</blockquote>
<p>^ cap</p>
```

```
> >
> > a
^ cap
.
<figure>
  <blockquote>
    <blockquote><p>a</p></blockquote>
  </blockquote>
  <figcaption>cap</figcaption>
</figure>
```
